      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've actually had several circumstances where it felt like the zoom distance didn't go far ENOUGH, but I'll grant that in at least one of those situations, it was because I was scaled down way smaller than everyone else. \n\nI can also understand the privacy concerns, however, and I don't think an indicator of where the third-person camera is would necessarily go amiss, either",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
