      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def38c9e0ae944b12e2bb6|full_name} I think, like with the personal camera, having it be an option for how visible others' are to you is what I imagine would be the \"best of both worlds\" option here. If you want immersion, and you aren't so concerned about where others' viewpoints are, then turn them off. But it can still be there for those who are justifiably concerned about some creepy rando trying to sneak a peek on them without their knowledge or permission",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
