      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Dalken Starbyne Probably good solution to have it function similar to camera visibility as a middleground sure. I set and forget that long ago, and forgot that was even implimented lest I need the feature and remember it exists. Then it could have it's solution for those who want it or not. \n\nIn that sense I guess I would have more of an oppinion on which the default behavior should be? As a non creep user of 3phan default. , I'd still prefer the personal privacy of not having my cameraher t viewpoint visibility broadcast to other users, so I'd like if an implimentation like this were opt in rather than default. Perhaps room for discussion here?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
