  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think the max distance of the 3p camera should be at least half of what it is now. It's kinda weird that we now have a camera that just can zoom in on people without them knowing it's there. The regular camera at least have the flying lens so you know it's there.\n\nEven if you're in 3p mode it feels like your view should be around where your avatar is. Not from across the street.\n\nIf people want to take pictures of their avatar in third person, they can already do that with the regular camera.",
